                  "text": "Mwa 8:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wala hawasemi mioyoni mwao, Basi, na tumche BWANA, Mungu wetu, aletaye mvua, mvua ya mwaka, na mvua ya vuli, kwa wakati wake; na kutuwekea juma za mavuno zilizoamriwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maovu yenu yameyageuza haya, na dhambi zenu zimewazuilia mema msiyapate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana katika watu wangu wameonekana watu waovu; huotea kama vile watu wategao mitego; hutega mtego, na kunasa watu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama tundu lijaavyo ndege, kadhalika nyumba zao zimejaa hila; kwa hiyo wamekuwa wakuu, wamepata mali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
