                  "text": "Isa 30:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manabii wanatabiri uongo, na makuhani wanatawala kwa msaada wa hao; na watu wangu wanapenda mambo yawe hivyo. Nanyi mtafanya nini mwisho wake?",
          "type": "text",
